{"kind":"article","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"State management","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"system-designs-google-maps-font-system-scaling-challenges-challenge.ios-app-nature.state-management-icon.codex.svg"},{"type":"card","identifier":"system-designs-google-maps-font-system-scaling-challenges-challenge.ios-app-nature.state-management-card.codex.svg"}],"color":{"standardColorIdentifier":"gray"}},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/laussat-studio\/documentation\/laussat-studio\/challenge.ios-app-nature.state-management"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"system-designs-google-maps-font-system-scaling-challenges-challenge.ios-app-nature.state-management-hero.codex"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This page records how the Google Maps typography system addressed “State management”."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Challenge","text":"Challenge"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"State management broke down because typography state lived in too many places."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Developers had 40+ APIs (enum, Objective-C class, direct "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIFont"},{"text":" usage) and no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"single answer for which entry point to use, so font choices and scaling logic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drifted across screens."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Fonts also could not use the custom color state harness. Typography state","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instead relied on dependency injection that reset state per test instance in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"concurrent test runs, which only 2 of the 6 test harnesses supported.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"System-design-response","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"System design response"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We centralized typography state behind a canonical font loader and provider:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Canonical entry: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import design-system\/typography\/fonts.h"},{"text":", then request the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exact font through the loader.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Provider resolves Material 3 tokens, applies Dynamic Type scaling, and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enforces locale fallback logic."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Adapters bridge UIKit and SwiftUI so scaling behavior stays consistent."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cache key is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"font family + font size"},{"type":"text","text":", evicted on memory warnings to prevent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state leaks."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Experiments can select a branded typography channel without custom branching."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iPad stayed on legacy typography for ~1 year, so the system preserved a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"controlled split-state path during rollout."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"We removed global state and moved into a dependency injection framework. This","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"was the first adopter of the new build approach, and colors were expected to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"follow the same method across the rest of the design system. We treated the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"experiment as a chance to level up."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Evidence and remaining risk","type":"heading","anchor":"Evidence-and-remaining-risk"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Evidence we used to validate the new state model:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Snapshot suites (100k+ images) across every surface and locale variants."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Simulator overrides for Asian languages to verify locale fallback behavior."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Migration sequences that reduced entry points to a small, testable set."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Remaining risks:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dynamic Type validation across all screens was deferred to a follow-up."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some screens required "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clipToBounds = false"},{"type":"text","text":" for tall ascenders, a layout"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"compromise we still track."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Diagram-Context-snapshot","text":"Diagram: Context snapshot"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"system-designs-google-maps-font-system-scaling-challenges-challenge.ios-app-nature.state-management-context.mermaid"}]},{"syntax":"mermaid","type":"codeListing","code":["%% file: system-designs-google-maps-font-system-scaling-challenges-challenge.ios-app-nature.state-management-context.svg","%% title: State management - Context snapshot","flowchart LR","  A[\"Challenge: